      "writtenOn": "2013-07-15T21:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One of the main reasons to have the config switch is so that if you enable it for a bit, create some inherited roles, then you want to be able to mute all those inherited roles if you decide you want to turn off the extension.  So it is not just about removing the ability to call one of the grant APIs",
